  "name": "Defensive Play",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You channel the power in your cards into a protective barrier. You Play a card and grant yourself a +1 circumstance bonus to AC for 1 round. If you Play a card of the Constitution or Wisdom suites, this bonus increases to +2 instead. If you Play a card of the Charisma suit, you gain no bonus.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.W40ssK5Hb3usfAlS]{Effect: Defensive Play}</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span> If you are wielding a shield, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.xjGwis0uaC2305pm]{Raise a Shield} when you Defensive Play. You benefit from this action’s circumstance bonus if it is higher than your shield’s AC bonus, and you gain the Shield Block feat for the duration.</p>"
